        Redesign batch 3: Home wordplay, the mix pages, Endless Listening (intro, station, ask the host).
        Greeting arrays come in pairs (_a = the wide first line, _b = the narrow second line) and must keep the same length.
        HomeWordplay picks the index; nothing here may claim a number that is not the listener's own.
    -->

